<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#F5F1E8', padding: '24px 72px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 104, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 34, background: '#A8402F' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                为什么要在展厅里放一个讲解员
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.5, marginTop: 8, letterSpacing: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                以下三条取自软件内「评审资料 · 应用价值」原文
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 512, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 38 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A8402F', width: 44, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                    01
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                        旺季讲解员排不过来
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                        一队人挤在碉楼底下，后面的人听不清，也看不见讲解员指的那一处。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A8402F', width: 44, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                    02
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                        办个临时展，讲解词要重写一遍
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                        换展品就得重新组织内容、重新培训讲解员，还容易口径不一。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A8402F', width: 44, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                    03
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                        游客随口问一句，讲解员不一定答得上
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                        「这楼为什么这么高」「窗户为什么这么小」——背下来的讲稿接不住这种追问。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.6, lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                游客听到的信息是碎片的：一段讲稿、一块展板、一句答不上来的「你去问讲解员」。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#2B4A45', padding: '38px 32px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.55, letterSpacing: 4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                我们的做法
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#F5F1E8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif", fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                把它做成
                <br />
                一台普通电脑
                <br />
                就能跑的东西。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 96, height: 3, background: '#A8402F' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    讲解词写进主题包，换展只改文件
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    游客怎么问都能接
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    接不上，就老实说不知道
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
            侨乡 · 江门 AI 智能讲解员
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
            02 / 14
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
